    "diagnosis": "Desmoid fibromatosis",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The lesion is composed of infiltrating long, sweeping fascicles of bland fibroblasts and myofibroblasts. The tumour cells demonstrate pale eosinophilic cytoplasm and lack nuclear hyperchromasia or cytological atypia. Thin-walled blood vessels are present within the lesion.",
